meta {
  name: S7 — A committed outbox row runs exactly one workflow
  seq: 7
}

docs {
  TICK-49. There is no platform HTTP route for workflows. Run `make demo-outbox DEDUPE_KEY=accept` twice first (see the guide), and `tools/tunnels.sh up` (with `COMPOSE_PROFILES=operator`) for the Temporal UI at `{{temporal_ui_url}}`. These requests read the Temporal UI's own HTTP API, as an operator would.
}
